Your hounds can now survive for up to [1, 1, 2, 2, 3 (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] turns after their hit points are reduced below 1.  While in this state they deal 50% less damage but are immune to additional damage.

Command Blink will now regenerate your hounds for [28, 38, 46, 52, 58 (TL1-5; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] life per turn and increase their global speed by [15%, 27%, 35%, 40%, 44% (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] for five turns.  Hounds below 1 life when this effect occurs will have the bonuses doubled.

When you learn this talent, your hounds gain [10%, 23%, 31%, 38%, 43% (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] stun, blind, confusion, and pin resistance.

The regeneration scales with your Spellpower.
